[0m[0m
The [38;5;10mrng.rs[0m module used [38;5;10mopenssl::symm::{Cipher, Crypter, Mode}[0m for AES-256-ECB encryption, and [38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m depended on the [38;5;10mopenssl[0m crate. This system doesn't have [38;5;10mlibssl-dev[0m headers installed, so the [38;5;10mopenssl-sys[0m build script failed.[0m[0m
