[1mFix:[22m Replaced the [38;5;10mopenssl[0m crate with the pure-Rust [38;5;10maes[0m crate (v0.8). The [38;5;10maes256_ecb[0m function was rewritten to use [38;5;10mAes256::new_from_slice()[0m and [38;5;10mencrypt_block()[0m instead of OpenSSL's [38;5;10mCrypter[0m. This is functionally identical — single-block AES-256-ECB encryption — but requires no system libraries.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
